  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "もちろん、完璧を目指すのも大事なことだ。\nけどよ……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_e:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "どんなに難しいことでもやり抜こうとする、\nその姿勢そのものだってカッコよくないか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_e:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "観客を確実に惹きつけるのは、完成された技術だ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "桜庭 薫"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_e:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "姿勢ばかり前向きで、中途半端な技術しか\n持たないアイドルが、魅力的に見えると思うか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "桜庭 薫"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_e:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "この際だ、言っておこう。君のその素人的な考えは、\n僕たちの活動の妨げになりかねない。前々から……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "桜庭 薫"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_e:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "も、もうっ……。ケンカは止めてください！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "柏木 翼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_e:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "薫＆輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_e:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "大切なのは、オレたちの姿で、\n見てくれた人を笑顔にすることじゃないですか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "柏木 翼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_e:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "歌やダンスが、どれだけ上手に出来たとしても……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "柏木 翼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_e:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ファンのみんなが笑顔になってくれなかったら、\nそれは……。オレは、意味がないと思います……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "柏木 翼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_e:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "一旦、気持ちを切り替えましょう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_e:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "輝さんと翼さんは、\nそろそろ次の仕事へ移動する時間ですよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_e:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 23
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "全員で冷静になるためにも、少し休憩しましょう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_e:step-25:text",
        "step_id": 25,
        "step_index": 24,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 24
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……いいだろう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "桜庭 薫"
